#!amber
SHADER compute main SPIRV-BIN FILE main.spv
BUFFER words DATA_TYPE uint32 DATA 0 1073217536 1413754136 1074340347 0 3221225472 0 1070596096 END
BUFFER doubled DATA_TYPE uint32 SIZE 8 FILL 0
BUFFER flags DATA_TYPE uint32 SIZE 4 FILL 7
PIPELINE compute p
  ATTACH main
  BIND BUFFER words AS storage DESCRIPTOR_SET 0 BINDING 0
  BIND BUFFER doubled AS storage DESCRIPTOR_SET 0 BINDING 1
  BIND BUFFER flags AS storage DESCRIPTOR_SET 0 BINDING 2
END
RUN p 1 1 1
EXPECT doubled IDX 0 EQ 0 1074266112 1413754136 1075388923 0 3222274048 0 1071644672
EXPECT flags IDX 0 EQ 1 1 0 0
